@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@*
    Distraction-free shell for auth screens (login, register): no site header or
    footer, so a full-height split layout can run edge-to-edge. NieFarm 2.0
    restyle (docs/plans/public-site-redesign-nf2.md §7, step 5.1) — only the
    ".nf" root class is added here; the split/collage layout itself lives in
    ".auth" (nf-pages.css) on LoginPage/RegisterPage's own root, same pattern
    as CheckoutLayout.
*@

<div class="nf">
    @Body
</div>

<div id="blazor-error-ui" data-nosnippet>
    Đã xảy ra lỗi không mong muốn.
    <a href="." class="reload">Tải lại</a>
    <span class="dismiss">🗙</span>
</div>
